{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Brownie's Adventure: The Final Resolution",
    "steam_appid": 3213350,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/2bb56c89f985a65b018d33f3764b6198.poster.avif?t=1750869350\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/2bb56c89f985a65b018d33f3764b6198.webm?t=1750869350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thoroughly original point and click adventure set between a vibrant fantasy world and the South Yorkshire/Derbyshire apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through working men's club parties, 24-hour all-night shrubberies, A post apocalyptic Peak District and fire-regulation-busting, volcano-adjacent coffee shops in this final comedy point and click extravaganza! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crammed to breaking point with clever puzzles, hilarious events and  a thoroughly 1990s adventure style.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/10d23e024eba460f58e40f4e3635d7b2.poster.avif?t=1750869350\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/10d23e024eba460f58e40f4e3635d7b2.webm?t=1750869350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/10d23e024eba460f58e40f4e3635d7b2.mp4?t=1750869350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/0e3fa3cd9c7e5c982ec5a714c2711780.poster.avif?t=1750869350\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/0e3fa3cd9c7e5c982ec5a714c2711780.webm?t=1750869350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 60 unique locations across two separate explorable worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1990s hand-drawn pixel art and several hundred crazy animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hours of original and hilarious dialogue across 6~10 hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Kluberries in the wilderness and exchange them for 'glimpses into the future' (optional clues)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A veritable orgy of puzzles and highly original mechanics to keep you scratching your head until it becomes raw and swollen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your very own achievement room with unique gifts and artefacts that link in with your steam achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-depth ambient soundscapes and audio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A live instrument recorded folk/fantasy original soundtrack of over 30 compositions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/33271c05355d8081ab6b8f25d4517d58.poster.webp?t=1750869350\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/33271c05355d8081ab6b8f25d4517d58.webp?t=1750869350\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/aa52cf1ec3a071265f4fa6864e09ce5f.poster.avif?t=1750869350\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/aa52cf1ec3a071265f4fa6864e09ce5f.webm?t=1750869350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renowned for its sharp writing, originality, absurd humour, and unforgettable musical compositions, the <i>Brownie's Adventure</i>\u00a0has reached it's final 'vinegar strokes'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every square pixel of this hand-drawn finale has been crafted with care, from its intricate puzzles to its sweeping, needlessly rich and orchestral soundtrack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a long-time fan or delving into the series for the first time, this epic adventure stands on its own while giving a solid high five to the absolute madness that made it possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/0c4166e4a2ed907cf4ef38e200c0720c.poster.avif?t=1750869350\" width=774 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/0c4166e4a2ed907cf4ef38e200c0720c.webm?t=1750869350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/0c4166e4a2ed907cf4ef38e200c0720c.mp4?t=1750869350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > So, gear up and crack on\u2014because if Brownie doesn\u2019t save the world(s), who will? The RSPCA? Ofcom? You, ideally. That would be great.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/2bb56c89f985a65b018d33f3764b6198.poster.avif?t=1750869350\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/2bb56c89f985a65b018d33f3764b6198.webm?t=1750869350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thoroughly original point and click adventure set between a vibrant fantasy world and the South Yorkshire/Derbyshire apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through working men's club parties, 24-hour all-night shrubberies, A post apocalyptic Peak District and fire-regulation-busting, volcano-adjacent coffee shops in this final comedy point and click extravaganza! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crammed to breaking point with clever puzzles, hilarious events and  a thoroughly 1990s adventure style.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/10d23e024eba460f58e40f4e3635d7b2.poster.avif?t=1750869350\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/10d23e024eba460f58e40f4e3635d7b2.webm?t=1750869350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/10d23e024eba460f58e40f4e3635d7b2.mp4?t=1750869350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/0e3fa3cd9c7e5c982ec5a714c2711780.poster.avif?t=1750869350\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/0e3fa3cd9c7e5c982ec5a714c2711780.webm?t=1750869350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 60 unique locations across two separate explorable worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1990s hand-drawn pixel art and several hundred crazy animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hours of original and hilarious dialogue across 6~10 hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Kluberries in the wilderness and exchange them for 'glimpses into the future' (optional clues)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A veritable orgy of puzzles and highly original mechanics to keep you scratching your head until it becomes raw and swollen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your very own achievement room with unique gifts and artefacts that link in with your steam achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-depth ambient soundscapes and audio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A live instrument recorded folk/fantasy original soundtrack of over 30 compositions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/33271c05355d8081ab6b8f25d4517d58.poster.webp?t=1750869350\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/33271c05355d8081ab6b8f25d4517d58.webp?t=1750869350\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/aa52cf1ec3a071265f4fa6864e09ce5f.poster.avif?t=1750869350\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/aa52cf1ec3a071265f4fa6864e09ce5f.webm?t=1750869350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renowned for its sharp writing, originality, absurd humour, and unforgettable musical compositions, the <i>Brownie's Adventure</i>\u00a0has reached it's final 'vinegar strokes'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every square pixel of this hand-drawn finale has been crafted with care, from its intricate puzzles to its sweeping, needlessly rich and orchestral soundtrack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a long-time fan or delving into the series for the first time, this epic adventure stands on its own while giving a solid high five to the absolute madness that made it possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/0c4166e4a2ed907cf4ef38e200c0720c.poster.avif?t=1750869350\" width=774 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/0c4166e4a2ed907cf4ef38e200c0720c.webm?t=1750869350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/0c4166e4a2ed907cf4ef38e200c0720c.mp4?t=1750869350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > So, gear up and crack on\u2014because if Brownie doesn\u2019t save the world(s), who will? The RSPCA? Ofcom? You, ideally. That would be great.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
